--- !u!114 &1661484806
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1661484800}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4d1095e5b69548740ac25a35d65f48bc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  registrationPanel: {fileID: 95376629}
  nameInputField: {fileID: 79326162}
  emailInputField: {fileID: 526334263}
  emailWarningText: {fileID: 1509803709}
  mentors:
  - mentorName: Aziz Sancar
    description: "Bir k\xF6yden \xE7\u0131k\u0131p Nobel \xD6d\xFCl\xFC'ne uzanan
      yolculu\u011Fuyla milyonlarca gence ilham verdi. H\xFCcrelerin DNA hasar\u0131n\u0131
      nas\u0131l onard\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ke\u015Ffetti ve kanser ara\u015Ft\u0131rmalar\u0131na
      yeni kap\u0131lar a\xE7t\u0131. Bilimin sab\u0131rla ilerleyenlerin dili oldu\u011Funu
      g\xF6sterdi."
    quote: "\"Ba\u015Far\u0131, merak\u0131n disiplinle bulu\u015Ftu\u011Fu yerde
      ortaya \xE7\u0131kar.\""
  - mentorName: Marie Curie
    description: "\u0130ki farkl\u0131 bilim dal\u0131nda Nobel \xD6d\xFCl\xFC kazanan
      ilk insan oldu. Radyasyon \xFCzerine yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131 \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar
      modern t\u0131bb\u0131n temelini de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi. \u0130lgin\xE7 olan
      ise, laboratuvar not defterleri bug\xFCn bile radyoaktif oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in
      \xF6zel koruma alt\u0131nda saklan\u0131yor."
    quote: "\"Hayatta korkulacak de\u011Fil, anla\u015F\u0131lmas\u0131 gereken \u015Feyler
      vard\u0131r.\""
  - mentorName: Louis Pasteur
    description: "Bir bardak s\xFCt\xFCn neden bozuldu\u011Funu merak ederek milyonlarca
      insan\u0131n hayat\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi. Past\xF6rizasyonu geli\u015Ftirdi,
      kuduz a\u015F\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ortaya \xE7\u0131kard\u0131 ve g\xF6r\xFCnmeyen
      mikroorganizmalar\u0131n d\xFCnyam\u0131z\u0131 nas\u0131l etkiledi\u011Fini
      g\xF6sterdi."
    quote: "\"\u015Eans yaln\u0131zca haz\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 zihinlerden yanad\u0131r.\""
  - mentorName: Rosalind Franklin
    description: "DNA'n\u0131n \xE7ift sarmal yap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n ke\u015Ffedilmesini
      sa\u011Flayan en \xF6nemli g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFClerden birini elde etti. Uzun y\u0131llar
      hak etti\u011Fi de\u011Feri g\xF6remese de bug\xFCn bilim tarihinin en etkili
      isimlerinden biri olarak kabul ediliyor."
    quote: "\"Bilimde ilerleme, g\xF6r\xFCnmeyeni g\xF6rmeye cesaret edenlerin eseridir.\""
  - mentorName: Alfred Nobel
    description: "Dinamiti icat eden adam olarak tan\u0131nd\u0131. Ancak insanlar
      onu sadece patlay\u0131c\u0131larla hat\u0131rlas\u0131n istemedi. Servetinin
      b\xFCy\xFCk b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn\xFC, insanl\u0131\u011Fa katk\u0131 sa\u011Flayan
      bilim insanlar\u0131n\u0131 \xF6d\xFCllendirmek i\xE7in b\u0131rakt\u0131.
      Bug\xFCn d\xFCnyan\u0131n en prestijli \xF6d\xFCllerinden biri onun ad\u0131n\u0131
      ta\u015F\u0131yor."
    quote: "\"\u0130nsanl\u0131\u011F\u0131n gelece\u011Fi, y\u0131kmay\u0131 de\u011Fil
      in\u015Fa etmeyi se\xE7enlerin ellerinde y\xFCkselecektir.\""
  - mentorName: Linus Pauling
    description: "Kimyasal ba\u011Flar\u0131n nas\u0131l olu\u015Ftu\u011Funu a\xE7\u0131klayarak
      molek\xFClleri anlamam\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011Flad\u0131. Hem Kimya hem de Bar\u0131\u015F
      Nobel \xD6d\xFCl\xFC kazanan az say\u0131daki insanlardan biri oldu. Bilim
      ile insanl\u0131\u011F\u0131n birlikte ilerleyebilece\u011Fini g\xF6sterdi."
    quote: "\"\u0130yi fikirler istiyorsan, \xF6nce \xE7ok fazla fikir \xFCretmelisin.\""
  - mentorName: Antoine Lavoisier
    description: "Modern kimyan\u0131n babas\u0131 olarak kabul edilir. Maddenin
      yok olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, sadece d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
      g\xF6stererek kimyan\u0131n kaderini de\u011Fi\u015Ftirdi. Bug\xFCn laboratuvarda
      yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n her reaksiyon, onun ortaya koydu\u011Fu d\xFC\u015F\xFCncelerin
      izlerini ta\u015F\u0131r."
    quote: "\"Do\u011Fa hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi yok etmez; yaln\u0131zca yeni bir bi\xE7ime
      d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCr.\""
  - mentorName: Niels Bohr
    description: "Atomlar\u0131n d\xFCzensiz bir kaos olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131,
      belirli enerji katmanlar\u0131nda davrand\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ortaya koydu.
      Bug\xFCn atom modellerini \xF6\u011Frenirken g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn halkalar,
      bilim d\xFCnyas\u0131n\u0131n ger\xE7ekli\u011Fi anlamak i\xE7in att\u0131\u011F\u0131
      cesur ad\u0131mlardan biridir."
    quote: "\"Bir uzman, ayn\u0131 hatay\u0131 tekrar tekrar yapm\u0131\u015F ama
      her seferinde yeni bir \u015Fey \xF6\u011Frenmi\u015F ki\u015Fidir.\""
  - mentorName: Dmitri Mendeleev
    description: "Periyodik tabloyu olu\u015Ftururken hen\xFCz ke\u015Ffedilmemi\u015F
      elementler i\xE7in bo\u015Fluklar b\u0131rakt\u0131. \u0130nsanlar ona inanmad\u0131.
      Y\u0131llar sonra bu elementler ger\xE7ekten bulundu ve tahminleri do\u011Fru
      \xE7\u0131kt\u0131. Bilim bazen g\xF6r\xFCnmeyeni g\xF6rebilmektir."
    quote: "\"D\xFCzeni g\xF6rebilmek i\xE7in bazen kaosun i\xE7ine dikkatle bakmak
      gerekir.\""
  avatarSprites:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 328b4bf4ced6b8542bf18bb316f511a0, type: 3}
