--- !u!114 &1661484808
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1661484800}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 712fb1113424f3c49b50582476b838a6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  guideCategories:
  - title: "ATOM S\u0130STEM\u0130 VE SENTEZ"
    description: "Elementleri parma\u011F\u0131nla (veya y\xF6n tu\u015Flar\u0131yla)
      kayd\u0131rarak laboratuvar matrisinde hareket ettir. Uyumlu atomlar\u0131
      \xE7arp\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rarak kimyasal ba\u011Flar kur ve yeni bile\u015Fikler
      sentezle (\xD6rn: H + H = H<sub>2). Her b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn ba\u015F\u0131nda
      sana verilen 'Deney F\xF6y\xFC'n\xFC okumay\u0131 unutma; ana hedefin, sol
      \xFCstte senden istenen molek\xFClleri \xFCretmektir."
  - title: "ENTROP\u0130 VE BASIN\xC7 (CEZA S\u0130STEM\u0130)"
    description: "Termodinami\u011Fin ikinci yasas\u0131 laboratuvar\u0131m\u0131zda
      da ge\xE7erli! Matriste hi\xE7bir birle\u015Fme (sentez) olmadan yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n
      her kayd\u0131rma hamlesi sistem bas\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r.
      \xDCst \xFCste 5 bo\u015F hamle yaparsan Entropi Patlamas\u0131 ya\u015Fan\u0131r
      ve sahana istenmeyen, rastgele bir ceza elementi f\u0131rlat\u0131l\u0131r.
      Kombolar yaparak (\xFCst \xFCste sentez) bas\u0131nc\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rla!"
  - title: "MENTOR DESTE\u011E\u0130 VE \u0130PU\xC7LARI"
    description: "Deney t\u0131kand\u0131\u011F\u0131nda yaln\u0131z de\u011Filsin.
      Se\xE7ti\u011Fin efsanevi Mentor, biriken sentez puanlar\u0131n kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
      sana hangi iki atomu birle\u015Ftirmen gerekti\u011Fini holografik olarak g\xF6sterir.
      Ancak unutma: Asistan yard\u0131m\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131d\u0131r ve e\u011Fer
      \"S\u0131nav Modu\"ndaysan t\xFCm ba\u011Flant\u0131lar kesilir, kendi bilgine
      g\xFCvenmek zorundas\u0131n."
  - title: "TERS\u0130N\u0130R TEPK\u0130ME VE JOKER"
    description: "Kimyada baz\u0131 reaksiyonlar geri d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFClebilir. \xD6l\xFCmc\xFCl
      bir hata m\u0131 yapt\u0131n? Puanlar\u0131n\u0131 kullanarak zaman\u0131 bir
      hamle geriye alabilirsin. Matris \xE7ok mu doldu? Joker (Hipotez) modunu a\xE7\u0131p,
      lazer sistemini kullanarak puan kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131nda istedi\u011Fin
      bir elementi matristen tamamen silebilirsin."
  - title: "TEOR\u0130K B\u0130LG\u0130 VE KURTARMA"
    description: "E\u011Fer matris tamamen dolar ve hareket edecek yer kalmazsa laboratuvar
      kilitlenir. Ancak her \u015Fey bitmi\u015F de\u011Fil! Kar\u015F\u0131na \xE7\u0131kacak
      teorik kimya sorusunu do\u011Fru cevaplarsan, sistem acil durum tahliyesi yapar
      ve matristen 3 elementi silerek sana ikinci bir \u015Fans (Revive) verir."
  - title: "OYUN MODLARI VE KAR\u0130YER"
    description: "Ayarlar panelinden laboratuvar ko\u015Fullar\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsin.
      'Normal Mod' dengeli bir deneyim sunar. 'S\u0131nav Modu' asistan\u0131 kapat\u0131r
      ama 2 kat puan verir. 'Serbest Mod' ise entropi cezas\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131rarak
      stressiz bir ke\u015Fif ortam\u0131 sa\u011Flar. Ba\u015Far\u0131lar\u0131n,
      kimlik kart\u0131na ve akademik karnene kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak i\u015Flenir."
  guidePopupPanel: {fileID: 1055433218}
  popupTitleText: {fileID: 312435941}
  popupDescText: {fileID: 687425070}
  popupCanvasGroup: {fileID: 1055433219}
